      <h2 id="worth-title">Are AWS exam vouchers worth it?</h2>
      <p>
        It depends on which price you compare. The <strong>voucher-only</strong> price is a straight discount — or
        premium — against the AWS list price. The <strong>+ Second Chance</strong> bundle is a bet on needing two
        attempts: it costs more than one exam but less than two.
      </p>
      <p>
